\p
\v 1 \add ≈So\add* Shelomoh¦160656 assembled¦160655 the¦160659 Israeli¦160660 leaders¦160665, and the¦160666 tribal and \add ≈clan¦160666\add* heads¦160665, in Yerushalem¦160675 \add to celebrate\add* the¦160679 arrival of¦160679 the¦160680 box¦160679 containing Yahweh's¦160682 agreement¦160680 coming from¦160683 David's¦160684 city¦160683, i.e., Tsiyyon/Zion.\x + \xo 8:1: \xt 2Sam 6:12-16; 1Ch 15:25-29.\x*
\v 2 \add *This¦160692 all¦160692 happened¦160692\add* during the¦160695 Celebration¦160699 \add in Shelters\add* in¦160697 the¦160697 seventh¦160702 month¦160697 of¦160697 Etanin.\x + \xo 8:2: \xt Lev 23:34.\x*
