\v 6 Then¦160758 the¦160759 priests¦160759 brought¦160758 the¦160762 box¦160762 containing the¦160763 agreement¦160763 into the¦160771 inner¦160771 room¦160771 in the¦160772 temple¦160772 (the¦160775 very holy¦160775 place¦160775), and \add placed it\add* beneath¦160779 the¦160780 wings¦160780 of¦160780 the¦160781 \add two wooden\add* winged creatures,
