\v 8 The¦160802 poles¦160802 were¦160801 \add very\add* long¦160801 and¦160803 the¦160804 ends of¦160804 \add *them\add* could be¦160803 seen from¦160806 the entrance to that inner¦160812 room¦160812, \add ≈but¦160813\add* \add otherwise\add* they¦160814 couldn't be¦160814 seen from the¦160815 outside¦160815, and¦160816 they're¦160816 still there¦160817 to this¦160820 day¦160819.
