\v 12 Then¦160877 Shelomoh¦160879 said¦160878, “Yahweh¦160880 stated that he¦160881 would dwell¦160882 in¦160883 the¦160883 cloudy darkness¦160883.\x + \xo 8:12: \xt Psa 18:11; 97:2.\x*
