\s1 Shelomoh's address to the people
\rem /s1 Solomon's Address to the People; Solomon's Speech
\s4 Full kingdom
\r (2 Chr. 6:3-11)
\p
\v 14 ⇔Then while all the people stood¦160909 there, the¦160895 king¦160895 turned¦160894 around and¦160899 \add ≈pronounced a blessing¦160899\add* on all Yisrael,
\v 15 saying¦160911, “Blessed¦160912 is Yahweh¦160913, the¦160914 god¦160914 of¦160914 Yisrael¦160915, who¦160916 spoke¦160917 \add ≈audibly to\add* my¦160921 father¦160921 David¦160920, and¦160922 then put into¦160924 action the promise he'd given,
