\v 21 \add ≈Meanwhile,\add* Shelomoh's¦165920 son Rehavam reigned¦165921 in¦165922 Yehudah¦165922. \add *He\add* was forty-one when¦165929 he¦165929 \add started\add* reigning, and¦165930 he¦165934 reigned¦165934 for seventeen years from Yerushalem¦165935—the¦165936 city¦165936 that Yahweh¦165940 had¦165939 chosen¦165939 \add ≈to¦165941 associate his¦165944 name¦165944 with\add* out of all¦165946 the¦165947 tribes¦165947 of¦165947 Yisrael¦165948. \add @Rehavam's¦165950\add* mother¦165950 was¦165951 Naamah¦165951 the¦165952 Ammonite¦165952.
